      "function": "withdrawAll",
      "vulnerable": true,
      "issue": "tx.origin auth",
      "detail": "withdrawAll uses tx.origin in a require statement for access control, which is vulnerable to phishing attacks where a user is tricked into calling a malicious contract."
    }
  ]
}
```

